e/load configuration system\n- Theme manager with customizable UI colors\n- Help tooltips for settings\n\n## Technical Features\n- Efficient rendering system for minimal performance impact\n- Auto-detection of new items as they spawn\n- Proper cleanup when unloading to prevent memory leaks\n- Frame-rate independent updating\n- Supports multiple game folders/containers\n\n## Support\n- Discord community access for updates and support\n- Regular updates and improvements\n- Compatible with most modern Roblox exploits","tags":[],"script":"-- discord: https://discord.gg/pWtMtcbn6w\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TrustsenseDev/MicroHub/refs/heads/main/loader.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"65008f6e276ab9d58e25b5a0","username":"Zyra","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/3c40581d7c33fb12f8c06bdf1da254670dbfb4aa9fc2440d2ca6c062878111f5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65008f6e276ab9d58e25b5a0-1694535646584.png"},"lvl":11,"status":"offline","id":"65008f6e276ab9d58e25b5a0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/3c40581d7c33fb12f8c06bdf1da254670dbfb4aa9fc2440d2ca6c062878111f5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65008f6e276ab9d58e25b5a0-1694535646584.png"}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":16372,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2025-03-22T09:31:14.492Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":0,"image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e1d97a54b8e6be5cd32095978c14ea0b7716d850ede955be27522069ce702ede.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/116495829188952-1742639284390.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/116495829188952-1742639284390.png"},"executes":42,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2